book></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, TAKUJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TATENUMA, KATSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAUCHI, MASANORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YATOH, HISANORI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A treating liquid (2) containing a fluoride is added to a cleaning liquid (1) discharged from a cleaning vessel (11), to react it with fluorosilicic acid in the cleaning liquid and thereby deposit a precipitate (4) containing a fluorosilicate, which is then removed. A cleaning liquid which has been regenerated in a regenerating unit (10) is fed back to the cleaning vessel (11) and is used as a cleaning liquid for a panel (20) for a cathode-ray tube.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un liquide (2) de traitement contenant un fluorure, que l'on ajoute à un liquide (1) de nettoyage issu d'une cuve (11) de nettoyage, pour le faire réagir avec de l'acide fluorosilique dans le liquide de nettoyage, et provoquer ainsi le dépôt d'un précipité (4) renfermant un fluorosilicate, que l'on sépare par la suite. On réintroduit dans la cuve (11) de nettoyage le liquide de nettoyage régénéré dans une unité (10) de régénération pour l'utiliser comme liquide de nettoyage pour un écran (20) de tube cathodique.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>